# `Work.CNum.CertTab` — the tabulated series values of the CNum certificate

`svUpTab k` (resp. `svDnTab k`) is the certified value of `svUp (ptOf k)` (resp. `svDn`), i.e. the
upper (resp. lower) bound of `log ‖h q‖` at the `k`-th grid point of the unit circle, obtained by
kernel evaluation of the 44-term series in `Work.CNum.serUp`/`serDn`.  The corresponding
specification theorems live in `CertUp*`/`CertDn*`.
-/

